---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"; import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro"; import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Glavas Engineering"><SiteHeader /><main><section class="section"><div class="container about-page"><div><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Façade and building-envelope thermal analysis.</h1></div><div class="about-page__copy"><p class="lead">I am an architect specialising in façade and building-envelope thermal analysis, with a background in façade engineering.</p><p>I hold a Master of Building Architecture from Politecnico di Milano. After working as a façade engineer, I moved into specialised thermal analysis and have spent the past three years working on the thermal performance of façade systems and building-envelope details.</p><h2>Experience</h2><p>I have contributed to more than 10 large-scale commercial projects in the UK.</p><p>My work has ranged from complete thermal-assessment packages covering multiple façade types and junctions to detailed 2D and 3D thermal analysis of individual complex connections.</p><p>This combination of façade-engineering experience and thermal modelling allows me to approach calculations with an understanding of both the thermal behaviour of a detail and how it is designed and constructed.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Discuss a project</a></div></div></section></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
<style>
  .about-page { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:4rem; }
  .about-page__copy { max-width:42rem; }
  .about-page__copy p { color:var(--color-slate); }
  .about-page__copy .lead { font-size:1.25rem; }
  .about-page__copy h2 { margin-top:4rem; font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.5rem); }
  @media(max-width:44rem){ .about-page{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.about-page__copy h2{margin-top:3rem} }
</style>
